.6,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/AXISCADES_28082026190954_Acquisition28082026.pdf"},{"symbol":"COCKERILL","ticker":"COCKERILL","company":"John Cockerill India Ltd","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"Rs 200.00 cr; ~5.0% of mcap","headline":"wins an **export contract of about Rs 200 crore from A1 Iron & Steel Tanzania** to design, manufacture and supply a pickling line, cold rolling mill, galvanising line and acid regeneration plant at Dodoma","amount_rs":"2000000000","notability_pct":"5.01","marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/46f140f6-4d34-4180-afb1-38c5ee9e9b7c.pdf","mcap":4045.8,"doc":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/46f140f6-4d34-4180-afb1-38c5ee9e9b7c.pdf"},{"symbol":"PATELENG","ticker":"PATELENG","company":"Patel Engineering Limited","event_type":"divestment","quantum":"Rs 55.00 cr; ~1.9% of mcap","headline":"completes the sale of its **32% stake in ACP Tollways to APCO Infratech and others for Rs 55 crore**, against a carrying value of Rs 26.02 crore in its consolidated books","amount_rs":"550000000","notability_pct":"1.91","marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/PATELENG_28082026165000_SEIntimationsaleofstakeinACP.pdf","mcap":2706.6,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/PATELENG_28082026165000_SEIntimationsaleofstakeinACP.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**KP Green Engineering** — **confirmed new orders of Rs 258.02 crore including taxes**, led by Rs 114.53 crore of solar module-mounting structures and Rs 92.38 crore of railway crash barriers, lifting this year's intake to Rs 497.64 crore _(~19.8% of mcap)_.","**John Cockerill India** — an **export contract of about Rs 200 crore from A1 Iron & Steel Tanzania** for a push-pull pickling line, a reversible cold rolling mill, a continuous galvanising line and an acid regeneration plant at Dodoma _(~5.0% of mcap)_.","**Waaree Renewable Technologies** — a letter of award from an unnamed Indian thermal power generator for **EPC of a 291 MWp ground-mounted solar project with a 280 MWh battery storage system**, for completion in FY 2027-28; the filing gives the order size as capacity only and states no rupee value.","**Acme Solar Holdings** — a letter of award from the Solar Energy Corporation of India for **300 MW of contracted capacity** under SECI's 6,000 MWh assured-peak-power tender (FDRE-IX), disclosed voluntarily and with no rupee value stated.","**Brahmaputra Infrastructure** — a **Rs 11.59 crore letter of award** from the Assam Health Infrastructure Development and Management Society to repair and renovate nursing schools at Dibrugarh and Tinsukia _(~2.6% of mcap)_.","**Meta Infotech** — a **Rs 4.08 crore renewal order** from a private sector bank for sustenance services running April 2026 to March 2027 _(~2.2% of mcap; a renewal, not new business)_.","**Shipwaves Online** — a purchase order of **USD 55,800 (about Rs 53.30 lakh on the filing's own conversion)** from TATA UK for a centralised shipment-tracking platform _(~1.1% of mcap; SME)_."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Kalind** — board approves **up to 27,48,00,000 warrants at Rs 11.50, aggregating not more than Rs 316.02 crore**, to public-category non-promoters on a preferential basis, with a relevant date of 28 August and subject to members _(~433% of mcap, a ceiling)_.","**Anondita Medicare** — files the Letter of Offer for the rights issue its board approved a day earlier, now sized at **9,58,000 shares for up to Rs 91.01 crore** in a 97:1,831 ratio with a record date of 2 September _(~4.9% of mcap)_.","**IIRM Holdings India** — discloses the post-issue holdings of its proposed preferential allottees of **15,70,352 equity shares and 88,98,657 convertible warrants**, led by Carpediem Capital Partners Fund II at 9.90%, correcting an omission from the AGM notice.","**Kabra Extrusiontechnik** — board swaps one non-promoter from the proposed allottee list of its 37,60,000-share preferential issue, and states there is **no change to the share count, issue price or aggregate size** already published; the list still runs from Kiran Vyapar and Singularity Large Value Fund III to Utpal Sheth."],"equity_allotments":["**Univastu India** — allots fully convertible warrants on a preferential basis to specified investors and receives **Rs 4,00,05,623 at Rs 87 a warrant**, being 25% of the issue price (new warrants; Rs 16.00 crore is our multiplication of that quarter by four)."],"m_and_a":["**AXISCADES Technologies** — board approves acquiring **90% of Cloud Wave Technologies, a Bengaluru precision-engineering company, for about Rs 234 crore in cash** at an enterprise valuation of about Rs 260 crore, with the balance 10% possibly to follow _(~3.4% of mcap)_.","**Patel Engineering** — completes the transfer of 84,95,040 shares, **32% of ACP Tollways, to APCO Infratech and individual buyers for Rs 55 crore**, against a Rs 26.02 crore carrying value; the associate contributed nil turnover and a Rs 12.73 crore loss last year _(~1.9% of mcap)_.","**McLeod Russel India** — signs an MoU to sell the **Tarajulie Tea Estate in Assam for Rs 22.75 crore** to Jaynath Tea Estate, to part-repay debt under a National Asset Reconstruction Company sanction; completion is expected by 31 October, subject to due diligence _(~4.4% of mcap)_.","**Gayatri Highways** — completes its purchase of **23.00% of HKR Roadways from Kotak Special Situations Fund**, a Hyderabad-Karimnagar-Ramagundam BOT toll road; the consideration is to be decided at consummation and no value is disclosed.","**Dhoot Transmission** — buys 75,000 shares at GBP 32 of **Dhoot Transmission UK, its own wholly owned subsidiary**, for **GBP 24,00,000 (Rs 31.32 crore on the filing's own conversion)** _(~0.1% of mcap)_."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — **8 companies filed** results or earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here."],"distress_risk":["**Kitex Garments** — India Ratings **downgrades** the ratings on bank facilities of Rs 347.98 crore, citing subdued FY26 margins from partial absorption of US tariff costs, a slower ramp-up at the Warangal unit, order-execution delays and a large debt-funded capex at KAPL _(~13.6% of mcap in rated facilities)_."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"label":"KP Green Engineering Ltd","ticker":"NAN","company":"KP Green Engineering Ltd","isin":"INE0QVH01025","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/c1fadf5b-c01c-4b2b-928f-15840850596f.pdf","mcap":null},{"label":"COCKERILL","ticker":"COCKERILL","company":"John Cockerill India Ltd","isin":"INE515A01019","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/46f140f6-4d34-4180-afb1-38c5ee9e9b7c.pdf","mcap":4045.8},{"label":"WAAREERTL","ticker":"WAAREERTL","company":"Waaree Renewable Technologies Limited","isin":"INE299N01013","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/WAAREERTL_28082026132427_LOA.pdf","mcap":8962.8},{"label":"ACMESOLAR","ticker":"ACMESOLAR","company":"Acme Solar Holdings Limited","isin":"INE622W01025","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/ACMECS_28082026131450_Intimation.pdf","mcap":29547.3},{"label":"BRAHMINFRA","ticker":"BRAHMINFRA","company":"Brahmaputra Infrastructure Ltd","isin":"INE320I01017","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/43c9ecd1-bba5-4da6-9d9f-7c5d00840222.pdf","mcap":475.4},{"label":"Meta Infotech Ltd","ticker":"NAN","company":"Meta Infotech Ltd","isin":"INE162901016","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLi